        <mxCell id="7htNaK2qTQP59l4bzaYh-57" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="HTTP ka QUERY Method&#xa;Yeh ek HTTP Request Method hai—bilkul waise hi jaise GET, POST, PUT, aur DELETE hote hain.&#xa;&#xa;Yeh kaam kaise karta hai: Aam taur par jab aapko server se data mangana hota hai, toh aap GET use karte hain aur usme URL ke through (? lagakar) parameters bhejte hain. Lekin agar aapki query ya search criteria bahut zyada lamba ya complex hai jo URL mein fit nahi ho sakta, toh naye HTTP standards mein QUERY method ka use kiya jata hai.&#xa;&#xa;Isme aap GET ki tarah hi server se data mangate hain (aur yeh safe/idempotent hota hai, yaani data kharab ya change nahi karta), farq sirf itna hai ki aap apni query ko URL mein ? lagane ke bajaye HTTP Request Content (Body) ke andar dal kar bhejte hain." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="180" width="560" x="45" y="2850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
